# spec: docs/protocol/dp-header.md#size
# provenance: PV-0020
# kind: dp-header
# description: Only 199 bytes: one byte short of a DP header, so the first message is truncated.
# derivation: A DP header is exactly 200 bytes (PV-0020); the input is the first 199 bytes of the testhost template (length 8), so IMPL-DP-3 reports truncated.
# expect.error: truncated
